<title>FINLAND: OUTOKUMPU SELLS GALVATEK IN MBO.</title>
<headline>OUTOKUMPU SELLS GALVATEK IN MBO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish metals and mining group Outokumpu Oy said in a statement on Monday it had sold its materials, machine parts and water purifier plant company Oy Galvatek Ab to its employees for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;Behind the deal is Outokumpu's wish to focus on core operations also in technology sales,&quot; Outokumpu said.</p>
<p>Galvatek's 1995 net sales were 53 million markka, it said.</p>
<p>Its Swedish subsidiary Galvatek WTT was not included in the deal, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
